Service Overview
The backup tools used for SAP HANA (in-memory database) fall under 2 categories 

SAP-native backups managed entirely by SAP HANA, and 

3rd party backup tools via SAP HANA BackInt API

Backint for SAP HANA is an API that enables 3rd party tool vendors to directly connect their backup agents to the backup and recovery capabilities of the SAP HANA database.

Azure Backup plugin/agent for SAP HANA is the SAP Backint–certified agent installed on SAP HANA databases running on Azure VMs that enables the Azure’s native backup service Azure Backup to perform application‑consistent HANA database backups and restores. Data and log backups can be individually configured to be created and recovered using this BackInt agent in Azure.

Backups are transferred via pipe/stream from the SAP HANA database to the Azure backup agent for HANA, which runs on the SAP HANA database server.

